{"sourceSha256":"80b22b3adb3290bd251bde65c98b78b60f24845ab43b70c1f4e3294e0b6f6c58","pdfPage":82,"items":[{"text":"Adecuación Curricular- Nivel Secundario","x":383.04,"y":756.75,"width":176.67979999999994,"height":11},{"text":"81","x":550.7491,"y":21.27,"width":11.286,"height":11},{"text":"Contenidos","x":286.0302,"y":470.9909,"width":45.81000000000002,"height":9},{"text":"Conceptos","x":82.81020000000001,"y":456.23990000000003,"width":42.10199999999998,"height":9},{"text":"Procedimientos","x":286.88520000000005,"y":456.23990000000003,"width":62.20799999999997,"height":9},{"text":"Actitudes y Valores","x":485.1372,"y":456.23990000000003,"width":75.86100000000016,"height":9},{"text":"La entrevista","x":49.1232,"y":441.48890000000006,"width":49.87799999999999,"height":9},{"text":"•","x":49.1232,"y":430.49090000000007,"width":2.223,"height":9},{"text":"Función y estructura","x":55.1262,"y":430.4909,"width":73.17,"height":9},{"text":"•","x":49.1232,"y":418.5929,"width":2.223,"height":9},{"text":"Roles de los/las participantes","x":55.1262,"y":418.5929,"width":103.46399999999997,"height":9},{"text":"•","x":49.1232,"y":406.69489999999996,"width":2.223,"height":9},{"text":"Tipos de entrevista: según el","x":55.1262,"y":406.6949,"width":101.43900000000002,"height":9},{"text":"objetivo y la modalidad","x":55.1262,"y":395.6969,"width":84.17699999999998,"height":9},{"text":"•","x":49.12319999999998,"y":383.7989,"width":2.223,"height":9},{"text":"Oraciones interrogativas","x":55.1262,"y":383.7989,"width":86.994,"height":9},{"text":"•","x":49.1232,"y":371.9009,"width":2.223,"height":9},{"text":"Los pronombres","x":55.1262,"y":371.9009,"width":58.536,"height":9},{"text":"interrogativos y","x":55.1262,"y":360.9029,"width":55.583999999999975,"height":9},{"text":"exclamativos","x":55.12619999999997,"y":349.90490000000005,"width":46.40310000000001,"height":9},{"text":"•","x":49.12319999999997,"y":338.00690000000003,"width":2.223,"height":9},{"text":"El registro formal e informal","x":55.1262,"y":338.0069,"width":98.32319999999999,"height":9},{"text":"•","x":49.12319999999997,"y":326.10889999999995,"width":2.223,"height":9},{"text":"Sustantivos abstractos","x":55.1262,"y":326.1089,"width":79.704,"height":9},{"text":"•","x":49.1232,"y":314.2109,"width":2.223,"height":9},{"text":"Formas verbales en primera","x":55.1262,"y":314.2109,"width":99.09810000000002,"height":9},{"text":"persona","x":55.12619999999999,"y":303.2129,"width":29.043000000000003,"height":9},{"text":"Comprensión oral (escuchar)","x":166.60019999999997,"y":441.5159,"width":111.06810000000002,"height":9},{"text":"Escucha atenta de la entrevista realizada a personas destacadas de la comunidad;","x":166.595,"y":430.9909,"width":302.75432000000035,"height":8.8},{"text":"anticipación del contenido a partir de la introducción; identificación de la intención","x":166.595,"y":420.4925,"width":302.7552,"height":8.8},{"text":"comunicativa que escucha; presentación (saludo, del entrevistado, del tema y el","x":166.595,"y":409.9941,"width":302.808,"height":8.8},{"text":"motivo), cuerpo (preguntas y respuestas), cierre (resumen de lo tratado y/o valoración","x":166.595,"y":399.4957,"width":302.78160000000014,"height":8.8},{"text":"personal), para mayor comprensión.","x":166.595,"y":388.9973,"width":132.132,"height":8.8},{"text":"Realización de inferencias basadas en las relaciones locales que existen entre las ideas","x":166.595,"y":378.4989,"width":302.83000000000015,"height":8.8},{"text":"que escucha, haciendo uso de las oraciones interrogativas y enunciativas, el tiempo","x":166.595,"y":368.0005,"width":302.79920000000044,"height":8.8},{"text":"verbal y el tono confesional que es propio de este tipo de texto; realización de las","x":166.595,"y":357.5021,"width":302.82735999999977,"height":8.8},{"text":"inferencias necesarias para comprender el sentido de la lectura que escucha.","x":166.595,"y":347.0037,"width":278.3431200000002,"height":8.8},{"text":"Producción oral (hablar)","x":166.595,"y":325.4909,"width":93.30210000000004,"height":9},{"text":"Establecimiento de la intención comunicativa en la que participa como entrevistador/a;","x":166.595,"y":314.9909,"width":302.79392,"height":8.8},{"text":"investigación y selección de los personajes relevantes de la comunidad para su","x":166.595,"y":304.4925,"width":302.7728000000002,"height":8.8},{"text":"realización, según sus valores, aportes y transcendencia; delimitación del alcance de","x":166.595,"y":293.9941,"width":302.7895200000001,"height":8.8},{"text":"la entrevista: público, temas y contenido; elaboración de las preguntas, ajustándose a","x":166.595,"y":283.4957,"width":302.82912,"height":8.8},{"text":"la intención comunicativa y al orden lógico con que se presentan las ideas. Realización","x":166.595,"y":272.9973,"width":302.79040000000055,"height":8.8},{"text":"de las preguntas, tomando en cuenta la estructura textual; desarrollo de estrategias","x":166.595,"y":262.4989,"width":302.83439999999996,"height":8.8},{"text":"de selección, registro y organización de la información necesaria para estructurar las","x":166.595,"y":252.0005,"width":302.78160000000025,"height":8.8},{"text":"preguntas en la que participa como entrevistador/a.","x":166.595,"y":241.50209999999998,"width":187.8624000000002,"height":8.8},{"text":"Selección del vocabulario temático y del registro a la situación de comunicación;","x":166.595,"y":231.00369999999998,"width":302.76488,"height":8.8},{"text":"incorporación de recursos no verbales (gestos, entonación, postura física, tono de voz)","x":166.595,"y":220.50529999999998,"width":302.76399999999995,"height":8.8},{"text":"para apoyar el contenido lingüístico adecuándolos a la expresión verbal.","x":166.595,"y":210.00689999999997,"width":262.09128000000015,"height":8.8},{"text":"Comprensión escrita (leer)","x":166.595,"y":188.4909,"width":101.94300000000001,"height":9},{"text":"Realización de inferencias basadas en las relaciones locales que existen entre las ideas","x":166.595,"y":177.9909,"width":302.83000000000015,"height":8.8},{"text":"de la entrevista que lee; inferencia, a partir del contexto del significado de palabras","x":166.595,"y":167.4925,"width":302.82472000000007,"height":8.8},{"text":"desconocidas contenidas en la transcripción; utilización del diccionario, en versión","x":166.59499999999997,"y":156.9941,"width":302.79304,"height":8.8},{"text":"física y/o digital, para buscar la definición de las palabras que lee cuyo significado no","x":166.59499999999997,"y":146.4957,"width":302.84320000000014,"height":8.8},{"text":"ha podido inferir. Realización de las inferencias necesarias para comprender el sentido","x":166.59500000000003,"y":135.9941,"width":302.75432000000023,"height":8.8},{"text":"global que lee; tomando en cuenta la estructura textual, la intención comunicativa, los","x":166.59500000000003,"y":125.4957,"width":302.7895200000001,"height":8.8},{"text":"temas tratados a través de las diversas preguntas y respuestas.","x":166.59500000000003,"y":114.9973,"width":221.7248000000003,"height":8.8},{"text":"Producción escrita (escribir)","x":166.595,"y":93.4909,"width":107.54100000000001,"height":9},{"text":"Establecimiento de la intención comunicativa de la entrevista en la que participa como","x":166.595,"y":82.9909,"width":302.7991999999999,"height":8.8},{"text":"entrevistador/a; investigación y selección de los personajes relevantes de la comunidad","x":166.595,"y":72.49249999999999,"width":302.7983200000004,"height":8.8},{"text":"para su realización, según los valores, aportes y transcendencia; delimitación del alcance","x":166.595,"y":61.99409999999999,"width":302.7552000000002,"height":8.8},{"text":"de la entrevista: público, temas y contenido. Elaboración de las","x":166.595,"y":51.495699999999985,"width":216.3392,"height":8.8},{"text":"•","x":477.385,"y":441.4909,"width":2.223,"height":9},{"text":"Interés por los temas","x":483.388,"y":441.4909,"width":74.51010000000007,"height":9},{"text":"presentados en la","x":483.388,"y":430.4929,"width":63.46800000000003,"height":9},{"text":"entrevista.","x":483.388,"y":419.49490000000003,"width":36.66600000000001,"height":9},{"text":"•","x":477.385,"y":407.5969,"width":2.223,"height":9},{"text":"Criticidad frente a","x":483.388,"y":407.5969,"width":63.38699999999998,"height":9},{"text":"las informaciones y","x":483.388,"y":396.5989,"width":68.37299999999995,"height":9},{"text":"opiniones de los/las","x":483.388,"y":385.6009,"width":71.44200000000001,"height":9},{"text":"participantes en la","x":483.388,"y":374.60290000000003,"width":65.95110000000001,"height":9},{"text":"entrevista.","x":483.388,"y":363.60490000000004,"width":36.66600000000001,"height":9},{"text":"•","x":477.385,"y":351.7069,"width":2.223,"height":9},{"text":"Valoración de la","x":483.388,"y":351.7069,"width":56.556,"height":9},{"text":"importancia de la","x":483.388,"y":340.7089,"width":62.76599999999998,"height":9},{"text":"entrevista como un","x":483.388,"y":329.71090000000004,"width":69.60600000000002,"height":9},{"text":"medio para conocer","x":483.388,"y":318.71290000000005,"width":72.48600000000002,"height":9},{"text":"las ideas y la vida de las","x":483.388,"y":307.71490000000006,"width":83.25900000000001,"height":9},{"text":"personas destacadas","x":483.388,"y":296.71690000000007,"width":74.295,"height":9},{"text":"de la comunidad.","x":483.388,"y":285.7189000000001,"width":62.198099999999954,"height":9},{"text":"•","x":477.385,"y":273.82090000000005,"width":2.223,"height":9},{"text":"Respeto por las ideas","x":483.388,"y":273.8209,"width":75.42000000000004,"height":9},{"text":"y los valores del/de la","x":483.388,"y":262.8229,"width":76.60799999999999,"height":9},{"text":"entrevistado/a.","x":483.388,"y":251.8249,"width":53.59500000000001,"height":9},{"text":"Área de Lengua Española","x":52.2943,"y":736,"width":103.38209999999997,"height":9},{"text":"Nivel Secundario - Primer Ciclo","x":251.9233,"y":736,"width":126.01619999999994,"height":9},{"text":"3er. Grado","x":498.57730000000004,"y":736,"width":42.86700000000002,"height":9},{"text":"Competencias","x":74.9563,"y":721.249,"width":58.0671,"height":9},{"text":"Fundamentales","x":72.0853,"y":710.4490000000001,"width":63.8091,"height":9},{"text":"Competencias Específicas del Grado","x":294.4483,"y":715.849,"width":146.70629999999997,"height":9},{"text":"Comunicativa","x":49.25230000000002,"y":684.7,"width":55.1061,"height":9},{"text":"Demuestra dominio, desenvolvimiento y creatividad al comunicarse eficazmente de manera personal y colectiva","x":166.7203,"y":695.6980000000001,"width":402.16410000000025,"height":9},{"text":"en su entorno familiar, escolar y de la comunidad, utilizando un género textual (funcional o literario), a partir de la","x":166.7203,"y":684.7,"width":402.2001000000007,"height":9},{"text":"comprensión y producción oral y escrita, la utilización responsable de las TIC y demás medios.","x":166.7203,"y":673.702,"width":333.4247999999999,"height":9},{"text":"Pensamiento Lógico,","x":49.25230000000002,"y":658.951,"width":82.79909999999998,"height":9},{"text":"Creativo y Crítico","x":49.25230000000002,"y":647.953,"width":68.16509999999998,"height":9},{"text":"Demuestra la validez de las informaciones sostenidas en los juicios, puntos de vista, conclusiones, acciones y","x":166.7203,"y":658.951,"width":402.1632,"height":9},{"text":"pensamientos que construye, usando un género textual que respete la diversidad de opiniones.","x":166.7203,"y":647.953,"width":355.89870000000025,"height":9},{"text":"Resolución de Problemas","x":49.25230000000002,"y":622.204,"width":100.40310000000001,"height":9},{"text":"Presenta resultados de investigaciones a través de textos específicos, orales y escritos, como ensayos o informes,","x":166.7203,"y":633.202,"width":402.17220000000015,"height":9},{"text":"que evidencian la solución de problemas en contextos determinados, con una postura de criticidad, valoración y","x":166.7203,"y":622.204,"width":402.1731000000001,"height":9},{"text":"respeto a los datos citados.","x":166.7203,"y":611.2059999999999,"width":96.41520000000004,"height":9},{"text":"Ética y Ciudadana","x":49.25230000000002,"y":590.9559999999999,"width":71.50500000000002,"height":9},{"text":"Produce textos en la elaboración de proyectos encaminados a la construcción de una ciudadanía responsable,","x":166.7203,"y":596.4549999999999,"width":402.18120000000033,"height":9},{"text":"abierta e inclusiva que busca soluciones colectivas a los problemas sociales.","x":166.7203,"y":585.4569999999999,"width":275.70510000000024,"height":9},{"text":"Científica y Tecnológica","x":49.25230000000002,"y":559.7079999999999,"width":93.30210000000001,"height":9},{"text":"Expone investigaciones científicas sencillas que realiza, apoyándose en el uso de textos de secuencia expositivo-","x":166.7203,"y":570.7059999999999,"width":402.13709999999975,"height":9},{"text":"explicativa en actos de intercomunicación que se desarrollan en la escuela y otros contextos, tomando en cuenta","x":166.7203,"y":559.7079999999999,"width":402.20189999999997,"height":9},{"text":"su conocimiento en la utilización de variadas herramientas tecnológicas con que cuenta.","x":166.7203,"y":548.7099999999998,"width":316.41030000000023,"height":9},{"text":"Ambiental y de la Salud","x":49.25230000000002,"y":522.9609999999998,"width":93.92400000000004,"height":9},{"text":"Promueve comportamientos y valores sobre la conservación de la salud, de la naturaleza y sus ecosistemas,","x":166.7203,"y":533.9589999999998,"width":402.16410000000053,"height":9},{"text":"mediante el uso de textos variados y a través del desarrollo de actividades de intercomunicación en diferentes","x":166.7203,"y":522.9609999999998,"width":402.1919999999999,"height":9},{"text":"contextos de la comunidad.","x":166.7203,"y":511.9629999999998,"width":103.34070000000004,"height":9},{"text":"Desarrollo Personal y","x":49.25230000000002,"y":497.2119999999998,"width":84.906,"height":9},{"text":"Espiritual","x":4